    "description": {
      "short": "Control your ADT Pulse security system and view sensor status through the Home app",
      "long": "Arm, disarm, and watch your ADT Pulse system from HomeKit, with the panel and nine kinds of sensors showing up as native accessories. Arm Night, an Alarm Ringing switch, and a guided setup wizard come included."
